# Per-session scratch state. Tracking it made every concurrent push collide —
# the Mac's daily driver and an interactive session would each rewrite these,
# and the resulting conflict left the driver's clone stuck mid-rebase, which
# silently stopped it generating videos.
.claude-flow/sessions/
.claude-flow/data/pending-insights.jsonl

